{"availability":"available","full":"palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io","name":"palestinerecord.github.io","description":"The Documented Record - an interactive record of the Israel/Palestine case, sourced to the underlying report","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-12T13:24:45Z","updated":"2026-10-09T05:37:46Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://palestinerecord.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://palestinerecord.github.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:12.985Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:12.985Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:12.985Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:15:24.725Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:12.985Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Israel and the Occupied Territories, 1917–2026: an interactive forensic survey of state conduct, alleged violations of international law, and the documented record.","The Documented Record is a free, open website that sets out the record of Israel's conduct towards the Palestinian people from the British Mandate to the present. It holds every figure, finding, statement and source in that record, and it shows each one with the body that recorded it. Each figure is plotted, each quotation names its speaker, and each finding names the court, commission or organisation that made it. The data behind every chart is published as plain JSON that anyone can download.","The record rests on a written survey: The State of Israel and Occupied Territories: A Forensic Academic Survey of State Conduct, Alleged Violations of International Law, and the Documented Record (1917–2026). As of October 2026 it runs to about 231,000 words in 36 parts and 205 sections, with 15 tables and a bibliography of 101 works. The site reproduces it in full and builds everything else on it: 108 charts and maps, 29 datasets, a chronology of nearly 470 dated entries and a catalogue of 151 statements and findings."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"349a36267a2f9f2fb5f3e74360ea8e4d704a90df97c637b928a2878ea59c9d6e","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:59.849Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:59.849Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Israel and the Occupied Territories, 1917–2026: an interactive forensic survey of state conduct, alleged violations of international law, and the documented record.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Every dataset behind the site is published as plain JSON over HTTPS, with no login and no key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"349a36267a2f9f2fb5f3e74360ea8e4d704a90df97c637b928a2878ea59c9d6e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:59.850Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T05:37:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/palestinerecord/palestinerecord.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:35:59.852Z","hash":"349a36267a2f9f2fb5f3e74360ea8e4d704a90df97c637b928a2878ea59c9d6e","originalBytes":41004,"storedBytes":41004,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["every","data","each","record","site","what","chart","page","survey","source","one","gaza","palestine","python3","figure","only","per","they","series","open","published","run","under","which","any","charts","check","checks","claim","figures","finding","list","names","ocha","repository","route","tests","build","date","genocide","nightly","state","curated","dated","documented","entry","how","icj","out","register","render","runs","snapshot","their","without","body","conduct","dataset","everyth